	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D. quanquam tibi, dilecte fili, scripserim per <persName ref="p477">Ioannem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Rodolphum</persName>, quia tamen eo profecturus es, quo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non licebit mittere literas, cum volo (nisi tu <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>viam inveneris <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName> et inde <placeName ref="l491">Argentin<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>am</placeName> ad <persName ref="p505">Burckherum</persName>; oporteret autem certum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te constituere hominem, qui acceptas ad te <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>certo mitteret et acceptas <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>te procuraret, de quo solicitus erit iuvantibus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>te d. <persName ref="p505">Burchero</persName> et d. <persName ref="p1227">Froschovero</persName>), rursus re<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>peto vetera.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Institutionem manu mea scriptam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>frequenter legito, deum timeto, creberrime orato, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>diligentissime studeto.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cave, ne quid tibi pereat <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>temporis, frugi et parcus esto, cogita te <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mox revocandum; volat sagittae in morem tempus; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fronte capillata post est occasio calva.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Si vero, quod minime puto futurum, <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>haerere aut commode manere non poteris, redi <placeName ref="l311">Mar<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>purgum</placeName>, inde ad me scribe de rebus tuis omnibus<note type="margin">a.R.: Tenta an d. <persName ref="p8386">Hyperius</persName> te recipiat, ad <persName ref="p1456">Happelium</persName> vero non divertes.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Si vero haeseris <placeName ref="l558">Witembergae</placeName> sive apud <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>d. <persName>Philippum</persName> sive apud alium virum et hospitem ho<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nestum et bonum, primo quoque tempore scribe, quid <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tibi responderit ad meas literas Philippus, quem <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>hospitem sis nactus, quanto precio te receperit et quas <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>audias lectiones, quae item sint studia <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tua, qui sodales tui.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Vide, ut ad singula haec <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>respondeas et praeterea significes, quomodo se studiosi <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l558">Witembergenses</placeName> erga te gerant et quid et quantum... sit <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>exponendum pro hospitio, lecto, victu, singulis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Para tibi regestum, scribe omnia, quae acceperis et <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>exposueris, sigillatim, <foreign xml:lang="de">wie und worum du es <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>uußgäben oder schuldig, das du mir söllichs yngeschlossen <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>uff die <placeName ref="l157">Franckfurter</placeName> mäß schickist.</foreign></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Iam <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>vero abi in nomine domini; benedictio dei <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nostri sit super te, deducat te deus et reducat <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>incolumem anima et corpore.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Huic protectori <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>tuo te commendo quotidie.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat et bene<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>dicit tibi mater.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Min liebs kind, hallt dich <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>gottsförchtig, eerlich, wol und flyssig.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Gott mitt dir; der behuͤt <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>dich trüwlich, amen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hoc, quod impositum est, habe a me et matre<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> ultima augusti 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/><persName ref="p495">H[einrychus] <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dilecto meo filio <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName> nunc <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vel <placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> vel <placeName ref="l157">Francfo<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>rdiae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
